---
<section id="about" class="section about-section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="about-heading" class="index-head">About</h2>

    <div class="about-cols">
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>
          uplb.tools is an independent collective of UPLB students building
          free tools for campus life: finding rooms, planning schedules,
          simulating grades. Everything is open source end to end. The code is
          MIT-licensed, and Room TBA's community-maintained campus data is
          published as open data under CC-BY 4.0.
        </p>
        <p>
          The org doubles as a training ground. Student contributors work
          through real GitHub pull requests, code review, and release cycles
          on apps with real users, the kind of experience coursework rarely
          provides.
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="about-principles">
        <div class="principle">
          <dt>Useful first</dt>
          <dd>
            Every tool exists because a specific campus friction did:
            enlistment, finding rooms, forecasting a GWA.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <dt>Open by default</dt>
          <dd>
            Public repos, open data, public roadmaps. Fork Room TBA for your
            own campus; the license invites it.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <dt>Respectful of students</dt>
          <dd>
            No ads, no data sold, no tracking beyond cookieless page
            analytics. Donations, not attention, keep the servers on.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .about-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-prose p {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .about-prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-principles {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .principle {
    padding-left: var(--space-sm);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brand-maroon);
  }

  .principle dt {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xs);
  }

  .principle dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .about-cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }
</style>
